+<!doctype html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+<meta charset="utf-8">
+<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
+<title>Giving Landscape — Frankly Inspired and Associates</title>
+<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/icons/favicon-32.png">
+<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/icons/favicon-16.png">
+<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/icons/apple-touch-icon.png">
+<meta name="theme-color" content="#172337">
+<meta name="description" content="A public, curated feed of major charitable gifts Frankly Inspired and Associates tracks - sourced from public announcements, with links back to the original coverage.">
+<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+<div class="brandbar">
+  <div class="wrap brandbar-inner">
+    <div class="brandmark"><span class="brandmark-f">F</span><span class="brandmark-word">Frankly Inspired <span class="brandmark-tail">and Associates</span></span></div>
+    <div class="brandbar-actions">
+      <div class="brandbar-tag">Giving Landscape &middot; Public</div>
+      <a class="brandbar-link" href="https://franklyinspired.associates" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Visit Site</a>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</div>
+
+<div class="masthead">
+  <div class="wrap masthead-inner">
+    <div class="eyebrow">Public &middot; Frankly Inspired and Associates</div>
+    <h1 class="title">Giving Landscape</h1>
+    <p class="dek">A running, public feed of major charitable gifts we track as part of our own research — each one sourced from a public announcement, with a link back to it. This is the same tracker we keep for clients, shown here without the case-study analysis and strategy notes we build privately for them.</p>
+    <div class="stat-row">
+      <div class="stat"><span class="num mono" id="gp-stat-count">&hellip;</span><span class="cap">gifts shown here</span></div>
+      <div class="stat"><span class="num mono" id="gp-stat-total">&hellip;</span><span class="cap">tracked across them</span></div>
+      <div class="stat"><span class="num mono" id="gp-stat-states">&hellip;</span><span class="cap">states represented</span></div>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+</div>
+
+<div class="wrap" style="padding:clamp(28px,5vw,44px) 0 80px;max-width:840px;">
+  <main>
+    <p class="load-note" id="gp-load-note">Loading&hellip;</p>
+
+    <div class="fw-card" data-panel="01 · Tracked gifts" id="gp-card" hidden>
+      <h3>Major Gifts We&rsquo;re Tracking</h3>
+      <p>Sorted by announcement date, most recent first. Every entry links back to the source it came from.</p>
+      <div id="gp-ticker-list"></div>
+    </div>
+
+    <div class="example-box" style="margin-top:20px;">
+      <span class="eb-label">On this page</span>
+      <p class="extra">Everything here was already public before we logged it — the donor, organization, and amount come from the announcement linked on each entry, not from any private relationship or filing we have access to. We keep our own case-study read on a gift (what it funds, what it signals, how we&rsquo;d advise a client to pursue something similar) out of this public view — that analysis is part of what a Frankly Inspired engagement includes. If something here needs a correction, <a href="https://franklyinspired.associates" target="_blank" rel="noopener">reach out through our site</a>.</p>
+    </div>
+  </main>
+</div>
+
+<script src="/giving-landscape-public.js"></script>
+</body>
+</html>
